<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-3/4 (FIM 192.61).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $42-3/4 (FIM 192.61).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed down $0-1/8 at $42-3/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 192.61 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia closed down 0.50 markka at 193.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed down $0-1/8 at $32-5/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 73.49 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed 0.50 markka lower at 74.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was untraded in New York after ending flat at $21 on Wednesday. Rauma fell 0.50 markka to 95.00 in Helsinki.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
